            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Definitions for filters</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Here you can read the definitions for each one of our filters in this project.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Filters for </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>adoption only affect adoption</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'> but filters and filters for </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>metrics affect only the metrics</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'> (in both charts).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>Filters</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Experiment</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Indicates if the vendor is part of the experiment for picker identity login or not. The default setting is for only new flow adopted vendors.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Granularity</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Specifies the level of view detail: Week, Month, or Quarter.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Local Date</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Select the dates for the period (up to 15 periods). </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Note: &apos;days&apos; granularity is not available, hence we recommend using Quarters, Months, and Weeks periods only.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Include null picker ids</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Some picker ids are null depending on the order. Select False if you want to remove them.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Default value excludes them but it does affect share within vendor metric.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Vendor App</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Choose between Godroid or Pelican as the vendor app. The default setting is for Pelican only.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Country</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Choose the country for the data view.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Store Type L1</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Select store types at level 1 (e.g., drinks, flowers, grocery, health and beauty, and other retailers).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Chain Id</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Input the chain ID.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Chain Name</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Filter for selecting multiple chains available. Note: influenced by other filters.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Vendor Id</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Input the vendor ID.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Vendor Name</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Filter for selecting multiple vendors available. Influenced by other filters.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>Acc Manager</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium'>: Input the account manager of the store.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
